sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Gateway as API网关
    participant Sentinel as Sentinel流控
    participant RateLimiter as @UserRateLimit切面
    participant Redis as Redis限流器
    participant Handler as UserHandler
    participant Service as UserService
    
    Note over Client,Service: Sentinel热点参数限流流程
    
    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/sms/send<br/>phone=13800138000
    
    Gateway->>Sentinel: Entry资源点检查<br/>resource=sms_send
    
    Sentinel->>Sentinel: 热点参数识别<br/>paramIndex=0 phone参数
    
    Sentinel->>Sentinel: 查询规则配置<br/>phone限流:10次/分钟
    
    alt 热点参数未超限
        Sentinel-->>Gateway: 通过
        
        Gateway->>RateLimiter: @UserRateLimit注解拦截
        Note right of RateLimiter: 用户维度限流<br/>userId级别控制
        
        RateLimiter->>Redis: 获取令牌桶<br/>key=user:rate:123
        
        Redis->>Redis: 令牌桶算法<br/>容量20 速率10/s
        
        alt 令牌充足
            Redis-->>RateLimiter: 获取令牌成功
            
            RateLimiter-->>Handler: 通过
            
            Handler->>Service: sendSms(phone)
            Service-->>Handler: 发送成功
            
            Handler-->>Gateway: 200 OK
            Gateway-->>Client: 短信发送成功
        else 令牌不足
            Redis-->>RateLimiter: 令牌不足
            RateLimiter--xGateway: TooManyRequestsException
            Gateway--xClient: 429 Too Many Requests<br/>用户限流
        end
    else 热点参数超限
        Sentinel--xGateway: FlowException<br/>热点phone超限
        Gateway--xClient: 429 Too Many Requests<br/>该手机号请求过于频繁
    end
    
    Note over Client,Service: 双重保护
    Note over Sentinel: Sentinel:热点参数级别(手机号/IP)
    Note over RateLimiter: UserRateLimit:用户账号级别
